{"duration_api_ms":8828,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d34aa80b-d1c8-46c7-9193-bef551d127c4","total_cost_usd":0.024924,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1117,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":799,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":34},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1117,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":799,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1117,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1117},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":799,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1117,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.024924,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":34,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"# Ticket Classification and Routing\n\n**Ticket input**\n- **User ID:** user_a\n- **Query:** \"The mobile app crashes with an error and is not working after the update.\"\n\n## Classification\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **category** | `technical` (Technical Issue) |\n| **owner_team** | Technical Support |\n| **priority** | P2 |\n| **sla** | 1 business day |\n\n## Decisions\n\n**1. Category: `technical`**\nThe query matches these keywords from the `technical` category: **\"app\"**, **\"crash\"** (in \"crashes\"), **\"error\"**, **\"not working\"** and **\"update\"**. This is also the configured `default_category`. It is the only category defined, so no other category competes.\n\n**2. Route: Technical Support**\nThe ticket goes to the `owner_team` defined for the `technical` category.\n\n**3. Priority: P2**\nThis is the priority set for the category. Nothing in the frozen data allows escalating or lowering it.\n\n**4. SLA: 1 business day**\nThis is the SLA set for the category.\n\n**5. Policy application**\nThe frozen policy says: *\"Collect reproduction steps and device information, then route to technical support for diagnosis.\"*\n- The ticket gives the symptoms (a crash with an error) and the trigger (after an update).\n- It does not include the reproduction steps or device information the policy requires. These must be collected, and the ticket then routes to Technical Support.\n\n## Next Actions\n1. **Collect reproduction steps.** Ask what the user does just before the crash, and whether it happens on launch or during a specific action.\n2. **Ask for the device and app version.** Ask for the device model, the OS version, and the app version installed after the update.\n3. **Route to Technical Support with logs if available.** Include the exact error message text or a screenshot, and any crash logs.\n\n## Missing Information\nThe ticket and frozen data do not include:\n- The exact error message text\n- The device model and OS (iOS or Android, and version)\n- The app version, and which update was installed\n- Reproduction steps\n- Logs or crash reports\n- Whether other users are affected (no incident data is supplied)\n\nNone of these have been assumed or invented. They should be gathered under the policy above.\n\n---\n*Fixture: customer-support-2026-09-16-v2-technical (SHA256 0cf815ee…b8f001)*","ttft_ms":1815,"type":"result","duration_ms":8877,"uuid":"d7c35266-4423-45fb-bd95-e0344c937998","ttft_stream_ms":1365,"time_to_request_ms":37,"first_content_frame_ms":1366,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
